sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant AS as Authorization Server
    participant JWKS as JWKS Endpoint
    participant API as Resource Server API
    participant Client as Client App

    AS->>JWKS: Publish old key kid=old
    AS->>Client: Issue token signed with kid=old
    Client->>API: API request with token kid=old
    API->>JWKS: Fetch JWKS
    JWKS->>API: Return public key kid=old
    API->>API: Verify token signature
    AS->>JWKS: Publish old key and new key kid=new
    AS->>Client: Issue new tokens signed with kid=new
    Client->>API: API request with token kid=new
    API->>JWKS: Refresh JWKS if kid is unknown
    JWKS->>API: Return keys kid=old and kid=new
    API->>API: Verify token with kid=new
    AS->>JWKS: After old tokens expire,<br/>remove kid=old
